<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55295" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατα-στορέννῡμι</span></b> , part.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καστορνῦσα</span> (as if from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταστόρνυμι</span>) (v. infr.): fut.
			-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στορέσω</span>: aor.
		
			Pass.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεστορέσθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>VM</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεστόρεσται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					15.194d
				</span></i>
			:—<i>spread, cover with</i> a thing, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάπετον] λάεσσι κατεστόρεσαν μεγάλοισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					24.798
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>spread upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώεα καστορνῦσα θρόνοις ἔνι
					δαιδαλέοισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					17.32
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				13.73
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>throw down, lay low</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεστόρεσαν αὐτῶν ἑξακοσίους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.69
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. κύματα</span>
			<i>smooth</i> the waves, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.668
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>): metaph., of morbid humours, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> l. c. (
				Pass.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τὴν ἀνωμαλίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Comp.Lyc.Num.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν φιλοτιμίαν, τὰπάθη</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Luc.</u>
				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.101c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν θυμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					103
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>layer</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλῆμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					4.3.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.1.7
			</span></i>.</div>
